Image files for the site live in this folder.

Filenames are lowercase and hyphenated, and are referenced exactly as-is from
the HTML — GitHub Pages is case-sensitive, so flatlay.png and Flatlay.png are
different files. See README.md for the full list of images the pages expect.

This file only exists to keep the folder present in git, which does not track
empty directories. It can be deleted once the images are here.
